{"id":"word:hebrew:H1077","type":"word","title":"בַּל","subtitle":"H1077 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, a failure ; by implication nothing ; usually (adverb) not at all; also lest","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to בַּל (H1077) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: adv.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 72 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"בַּל (bal) means properly, a failure ; by implication nothing ; usually (adverb) not at all; also lest First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 30."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"בַּל","transliteration":"bal","pronunciation":"bal","strong":"H1077","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1077","partOfSpeech":"adv","forms":["בַּל","וּ/בַל","בַל","בַּֽל","בַֽל"],"morphs":[["HTn",63],["HC/Tn",9]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, a failure ; by implication nothing ; usually (adverb) not at all; also lest","usage":"lest, neither, no, none (that...), not (any), nothing.","full":"H1077. bal בַּל 69 adverb not (Phoenician id.: e.g. CIS i. 165, 15 לכהן יכן בל shall not be for the priest; :3, 3 עתי בל = before my time) a poetic synonym of לֹא , of comparatively rare occurrence, Hosea 7:2 ; 9:16 (Qr) Isa 14:21 ; 35:9 ; 43:17 ; Prov 9:13 ; 14:7 ; 19:23 ; 22:29 ; 23:7 , 35 (twice in verse); 24:23 ; 1Chr 16:30 ( = Psa 96:10 ), only besides, except in the passages cited, in other Psalms: often repeated in the same context, as Isa 26:10 (twice in verse); 26:11 , 14 (twice in verse); 26:18 (twice in verse); 33:20 (twice in verse); 33:21 , 23 (twice in verse); 33:24 ; 44:8-9 , (3 t. in verse); Psa 10:4 ; 10:6 ; 10:11 ; 10:15 ; 10:18 ; 16:2 ; 16:4 (twice in verse); 16:8 ; 17:3 (twice in verse); 17:5 ; 21:3 ; 21:8 ; 21:12 ; also used often with תִּמּוֺט יִמּוֺט, אֶמּוֺט, 10:6 ; 16:8 ; 21:8 ; 30:7 ; 46:6 ; 93:1 ; 96:10 ; 104:5 ; Prov 10:30 ; 12:3 ; Job 41:15 . In Isa 40:24 it is probably that it acquires from the context the sense of hardly: yea, hardly are they planted, yea, hardly are they sown ..., when he even bloweth upon them, and they wither; compare לֹא 2Kin 20:4 . Joined anomalously with an infin., Psa 32:9 אֵלֶיךָ קְרוֺב בַּל (else) there is not coming nigh thee (i.e. else they will not approach thee).","rootNote":"from 1086 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 30","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 30","Hos 7 2","Hos 9 16","Isa 14 21","Isa 26 10","Isa 26 10","Isa 26 11","Isa 26 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":72,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 30","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Hos 7 2","book":"Hos","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בַל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Tn"},{"reference":"Hos 9 16","book":"Hos","chapter":9,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַֽל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 14 21","book":"Isa","chapter":14,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 10","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 10","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בַל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Tn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 11","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 14","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 14","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 18","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTn"},{"reference":"Isa 26 18","book":"Isa","chapter":26,"ver